title: Dashboard › Lifecycle › Active and Renewal due open Authorizations
route: /dashboard
intro: Active and Renewal due describe approved authorizations on the Case Manager ledger, not rows of the Dashboard table, so they are links with a small arrow and not filters. A click opens Authorizations on the All view with the matching Showing chip, and the number of rows there is the number on the chip. The chips' screen-reader label still says 'Opens Case Manager.'
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Dashboard is open\nTwo chips with an arrow after the five state chips"
process p1 "Take the ledger cases at the sites in view\nPayer, Program and Request type menus do not change these two counts"
decision d1 "Which chip?"
process a1 "Active = approved with units or days left, and the approval has not ended\n(example: 40; 22 at Site A and 18 at Site B)\nQuiet line '6 approved today'"
process a2 "Renewal due = approved, and the clinical review is due, or the approval ends within 7 days, or already ended\n(example: 19)\nQuiet line 'next: R-0856, 2 h'"
click c1 "Click 'Active' (or 'Renewal due')\nIt is a link, so Tab and Enter work and a right click can open it in a new tab"
process p2 "Authorizations opens on the All view\nAddress /authorizations?view=all&show=active or show=renewal"
screen sc "Authorizations\nThe worklist with the chip 'Showing Active (approved, units left)' or 'Showing Renewal due (review due or ending within 7 days)'\n'Clear filters' appears"
decision d2 "Is the viewer limited to one site?"
screen s1b "Only that site's cases\nSite A: Active 22, Renewal due 10; Site B: 18 and 9"
click c2 "Click 'Clear filters' on Authorizations"
process p3 "The filter goes and the address loses ?show="
end e1 "Every authorization in the All view is listed again"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Worklist › Deadline, More and the Showing chip"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Approved › Approved authorizations and their units"
goto g3 "Continues in: Dashboard › Sites › What each site sees and out-of-site links"

s1 --> p1 --> d1
d1 -->|Active| a1 --> c1
d1 -->|Renewal due| a2 --> c1
c1 --> p2 --> sc
sc --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| s1b
sc --> c2 --> p3 --> e1
sc --> g1
sc -.-> g2
s1b -.-> g3
